'''Droid Repair''' was a business located near [[Cid's Parlor]] in [[Ord Mantell City]] on the [[planet]] [[Ord Mantell]]. It offered repair service for [[droid]]s which was advertised on a [[Color|white]] and green sign. An [[astromech droid]] was pictured on it.<ref name="Ground" />

